        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If coverage and adequate reimbursement are not available, or are available only at limited levels, successful commercialization of, and obtaining a satisfactory financial return on, any product we develop may not be possible.",
        "start_character": 78171,
        "end_character": 78396
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001837607-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001837607-26-000019-193bf3d8c0f01cec",
        "accession_number": "0001837607-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we are successful in obtaining approval of a Section 351(k) BLA for therapeutic indications of ABP-450, we believe the ASP for ABP-450 would be calculated using only therapeutic sales, which we believe would facilitate consistent and favorable product reimbursement to physicians when they choose to use ABP-450 for therapeutic treatments, as well as the ability to provide payors and/or providers with rebates and other financial incentives.",
        "start_character": 12315,
        "end_character": 12760
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001837607-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001837607-26-000019-193bf3d8c0f01cec",
        "accession_number": "0001837607-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Numerous companies are engaged in the development, manufacture and marketing of products competitive with those that we are developing.",
        "start_character": 51401,
        "end_character": 51536
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001837607-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001837607-26-000019-193bf3d8c0f01cec",
        "accession_number": "0001837607-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Pharmaceutical companies are subject to additional healthcare regulation and enforcement by the federal government and by authorities in the states and foreign jurisdictions in which they conduct their business that may constrain the financial arrangements and relationships through which we research, as well as sell, market, and distribute any products for which we obtain marketing authorization.",
        "start_character": 75304,
        "end_character": 75703
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001837607-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001837607-26-000019-193bf3d8c0f01cec",
        "accession_number": "0001837607-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that a product designed to align with the reference product’s clinical profile and breadth of indications, and that can be positioned within existing reimbursement frameworks, including in a buy-and-bill setting, may enable physicians to integrate ABP-450, if approved, into established practice workflows without requiring changes to dosing or administration protocols.",
        "start_character": 34695,
        "end_character": 35076
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001837607-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001837607-26-000019-193bf3d8c0f01cec",
        "accession_number": "0001837607-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We do not expect to receive any revenue from ABP-450 or any future product candidates that we develop unless and until we obtain regulatory approval and commercialize ABP-450 or any future product candidates.",
        "start_character": 13888,
        "end_character": 14096
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001837607-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001837607-26-000019-193bf3d8c0f01cec",
        "accession_number": "0001837607-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "ABP-450 is the same botulinum toxin as Jeuveau®, which we license from Daewoong, and have exclusive development and distribution rights for therapeutic indications in the U.S., Canada, the European Union, the United Kingdom, and certain other",
        "start_character": 9538,
        "end_character": 9780
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001837607-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001837607-26-000019-193bf3d8c0f01cec",
        "accession_number": "0001837607-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Daewoong is responsible for all costs related to the manufacturing of ABP-450, including costs related to the operation and upkeep of its manufacturing facility, and we are responsible for all costs related to obtaining and maintaining regulatory approval, including clinical expenses, and commercialization of ABP-450.",
        "start_character": 43355,
        "end_character": 43674
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001837607-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001837607-26-000019-193bf3d8c0f01cec",
        "accession_number": "0001837607-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to the injectable botulinum toxin dose forms, we are aware that other companies are developing topical botulinum toxins for therapeutic indications.",
        "start_character": 54097,
        "end_character": 54257
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001837607-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001837607-26-000019-193bf3d8c0f01cec",
        "accession_number": "0001837607-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "On December 20, 2019, we entered into the Daewoong Agreement, pursuant to which Daewoong agreed to manufacture and supply ABP-450 and grant us an exclusive license for therapeutic indications to import, distribute, promote, market, develop, offer for sale, and otherwise commercialize or exploit ABP-450 in the United States and its territories and possessions, the European Union, the United Kingdom, Canada, Australia, Russia, the Commonwealth of Independent States, and South Africa, which we refer to collectively as the “covered territories.”",
        "start_character": 42558,
        "end_character": 43105
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001837607-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001837607-26-000019-193bf3d8c0f01cec",
        "accession_number": "0001837607-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our development program is focused exclusively on therapeutic indications, where we believe the biosimilar pathway may enable efficient development and broad label access, subject to regulatory review.",
        "start_character": 4076,
        "end_character": 4277
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001837607-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001837607-26-000019-193bf3d8c0f01cec",
        "accession_number": "0001837607-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a biopharmaceutical company focused on developing ABP-450 as a biosimilar to Botox® (onabotulinumtoxinA) for therapeutic indications.",
